cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LIBRA, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "LIBRA – Crossover Randomizer"
abstract: >-
  LIBRA (Linear Integer Programming for Balanced Randomization) randomizes crossover and other
  repeated-measures designs by integer linear programming: balance across periods and carry-over
  within every stratum, user-defined rules, and a random choice among the best designs.
version: 1.0.0
